        "product_summary": "Perforated microfiber leather upper: The visible hole pattern gives this low-cut loafer a distinct summer casual look.\nSlip-on opening: Side inserts and an open instep eliminate traditional lace tying.\nApron-toe and sidewall stitching: Visible seams and a textured sole edge define the rounded casual profile.\nMaterial combination: Microfiber leather lining, PU insole and rubber outsole are specified for this style.\nFive-color assortment: Black, Brown, Khaki, White and Yellow, EU 38-46. Share your target color-size mix for a wholesale quotation.",
        "company_summary": "Quanzhou Beiqiang Footwear & Apparel Co., Ltd. is a footwear manufacturer based in Quanzhou, Fujian, China. We work with importers, wholesalers, brand owners and e-commerce businesses on wholesale and OEM/ODM footwear projects. From selecting existing styles to developing a design brief, reviewing samples and planning packaging, we help buyers turn their requirements into a clear order plan. Share your product direction and purchasing needs to discuss a suitable cooperation proposal."
